			<DisplayName>Heli Optics (TADS)</DisplayName>
			<Description>>Range: 4000m
				>Max Targets: 1
					>MinAzimuth: -95 Degrees
						>MaxAzimuth: 95 Degrees
							>MinElevation: -60 Degrees
								>MaxElevation: 20 Degrees
									The Target Acquisition and Designation Sights (TADS) is the combined sensor and targeting unit.
									It is a crucial part in target acquisition and fire control for laser-guided ATGM's.
								</Description>
								<Icon>Textures\GUI\Icons\Cubes\Heli_Optics.dds</Icon>
								<CubeSize>Small</CubeSize>
								<BlockTopology>TriangleMesh</BlockTopology>
								<Size x="1" y="1" z="1"/>
								<ModelOffset x="0" y="0" z="0"/>
								<Model>Models\Cubes\small\Heli_Optics.mwm</Model>
								<Components>
									<Component Subtype="InteriorPlate" Count="10" />
